  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Otway &amp; Orford bring a touch of style, a pop of colour and the perfect finishing touch to more casual as well as formal jacket and suits, with unique and luxurious men's silk pocket squares that are Made in England.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>The 'Passions' designs feature vibrant &amp; original works of art, in collaboration with artists &amp; galleries, that depict iconic aircraft, legendary cars &amp; favourite sports. The 'Fresh Classics' are a fresh take on classic pocket square designs discovered in the archives, including polka dots, paisleys &amp; repeat patterns.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>These beautiful silk pocket squares never fail to strike a chord with the wearer. Also perfect for a thoughtful present on any occasion with their smart branded gift box.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Affiliate commission is payable within the first week of the month following the sale.</p></div>",
